    // A depth-0 GROUP/ORDER only starts a real GROUP BY / ORDER BY clause when
    // followed by BY; otherwise (e.g. STRING_AGG(...) WITHIN GROUP (...)) it is
    // part of an expression and must not terminate the select list or a clause.
