    /* ======================================================================
     * 3. Toast notifications
     * ==================================================================== */
    /* Durations: success 2 s, info 4 s, warning 6 s, error 10 s, or the caller's own. */
    /* Errors close on their own too: centred under the toolbar, sticky ones stacked up over the query.
     * A toast that must stay passes { sticky: true }. */
